  "releaseNotes": "- Fixed incorrect links in QUICK_START.md\n\t\t    - Renamed BaseEntityUpdatableController to BaseEntityEditableController to follow the Nano naming convension\n\t\t    - Added parameterless overload for API client entity Index method.\n\t\t    - Fixed querystring \"null\" value in request logging\n\t\t    - Added missing Nano.Web to Nano.All\n\t\t    - Changed ProblemDetailsException.Message to use both Title and Detail, unless detail is null or empty\n\t\t    - Added entity refresh after sign-up to ensure included references are included in the response\n\t\t    - Cosmetic improvements\n\t\t    - Updated NuGet packages",
